From: Thunderstorm1708 <89205550+Thunderstorm1708@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:49:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] sdm: udfps: Always strip the FOD bit from the z order

The FOD pressed bit was only removed from the z order when the pressed
state changed, so on later SetLayerZOrder calls the bit stayed in z_.
Strip it every time.
---
 composer/hwc_layers.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/composer/hwc_layers.cpp b/composer/hwc_layers.cpp
index e32276f..fb6545e 100644
--- a/composer/hwc_layers.cpp
+++ b/composer/hwc_layers.cpp
@@ -711,9 +711,9 @@ HWC3::Error HWCLayer::SetLayerZOrder(uint32_t z) {
   bool fod_pressed = z & FOD_PRESSED_LAYER_ZORDER;
   if (fod_pressed_ != fod_pressed) {
     fod_pressed_ = fod_pressed;
-    z &= ~FOD_PRESSED_LAYER_ZORDER;
     geometry_changes_ |= kZOrder;
   }
+  z &= ~FOD_PRESSED_LAYER_ZORDER;
 #endif
 
   if (z_ != z) {
-- 
